        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hook, Darrell Roberts\n- Organizations: Five Finger Death Punch, RIAA\n- Works: War Is the Answer\n- Places/Charts: Billboard 200\n- Companies: Prospect Park\n\nFacts:\n- Hook replaced previous guitarist Darrell Roberts in Five Finger Death Punch before the band released War Is the Answer.\n- War Is the Answer was released on September 22, 2009 through Prospect Park.\n- In 2009, Five Finger Death Punch released War Is the Answer.\n- War Is the Answer reached the top ten of the Billboard 200.\n- War Is the Answer was certified platinum by the RIAA.",
